AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::addCollateral()
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused for PAUSE_TYPE
├── when market is frozen but not paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused for FROZEN_TYPE
├── given invalid inputs
│   ├── when onBehalf is not creditAccount
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when onBehalf is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when assets is zero for creditAccount
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoBaseMarketInvalidInput
│   └── when assets cannot fit in uint128 position accounting
│       └── it should revert without changing state
├── given Convex strategy is inactive
│   ├── it should revert with AltoCreditMarketInvalidInput
│   ├── it should not transfer collateral
│   └── it should not update the credit account position
├── given collateral transfer fails
│   ├── when caller balance is insufficient
│   │   └── it should revert atomically
│   └── when caller allowance is insufficient
│         └── it should revert atomically
├── given Convex deposit fails
│   ├── when approving the exact deposit amount fails
│   │   └── it should revert atomically before calling the Booster
│   ├── when Booster call reverts
│   │   └── it should propagate the failure and roll back the collateral transfer
│   ├── when Booster returns false
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoConvexCreditLineExternalCallFailed
│   ├── when clearing the temporary approval fails
│   │   └── it should roll back the Convex deposit and all accounting
│   ├── when Booster attempts to transfer more than assets
│   │   └── it should revert because the temporary allowance is capped at assets
│   └── when an external dependency attempts reentrancy
│       └── it should reject reentrancy and revert atomically
└── given a valid deposit for creditAccount
    ├── when caller is creditAccount
    │   └── it should succeed
    ├── when caller is an unrelated account
    │   └── it should succeed without position authorization
    ├── it should transfer exactly assets of raw LP from caller
    ├── it should call Booster deposit with the configured PID assets and stake true
    ├── it should approve only assets for the Booster call and leave allowance at zero afterward
    ├── it should restore the prior idle LP balance
    ├── it should preserve any raw LP that was already idle before the deposit
    ├── it should increase market staked collateral by exactly assets
    ├── it should preserve the full pre-deposit staked balance
    ├── it should increase only creditAccount collateralAssets by assets
    ├── it should not change totalSupply totalBorrowed or debt shares
    ├── it should emit CollateralStaked before AddCollateral
    ├── it should include msg.sender and assets in CollateralStaked
    ├── it should support repeated deposits by different callers into the same creditAccount position
    └── it should return assets
